; THIEF-MELEE from pinned 1actions.zil, preserving choice counts.
@Z_LOAD_THIEF_TEXT
VARSET Z_THIEF_REMARK_COUNT
VARSET Z_THIEF_REMARKS
Z_THIEF_REMARK_COUNT:1 = 4
Z_THIEF_REMARKS:1:0 '= "The thief stabs nonchalantly with his stiletto and misses."
Z_THIEF_REMARKS:1:1 '= "You dodge as the thief comes in low."
Z_THIEF_REMARKS:1:2 '= "You parry a lightning thrust, and the thief salutes you with\na grim nod."
Z_THIEF_REMARKS:1:3 '= "The thief tries to sneak past your guard, but you twist away."
Z_THIEF_REMARK_COUNT:2 = 2
Z_THIEF_REMARKS:2:0 '= "Shifting in the midst of a thrust, the thief knocks you unconscious\nwith the haft of his stiletto."
Z_THIEF_REMARKS:2:1 '= "The thief knocks you out."
Z_THIEF_REMARK_COUNT:3 = 3
Z_THIEF_REMARKS:3:0 '= "Finishing you off, the thief inserts his blade into your heart."
Z_THIEF_REMARKS:3:1 '= "The thief comes in from the side, feints, and inserts the blade\ninto your ribs."
Z_THIEF_REMARKS:3:2 '= "The thief bows formally, raises his stiletto, and with a wry grin,\nends the battle and your life."
Z_THIEF_REMARK_COUNT:4 = 4
Z_THIEF_REMARKS:4:0 '= "A quick thrust pinks your left arm, and blood starts to\ntrickle down."
Z_THIEF_REMARKS:4:1 '= "The thief draws blood, raking his stiletto across your arm."
Z_THIEF_REMARKS:4:2 '= "The stiletto flashes faster than you can follow, and blood wells\nfrom your leg."
Z_THIEF_REMARKS:4:3 '= "The thief slowly approaches, strikes like a snake, and leaves\nyou wounded."
Z_THIEF_REMARK_COUNT:5 = 4
Z_THIEF_REMARKS:5:0 '= "The thief strikes like a snake! The resulting wound is serious."
Z_THIEF_REMARKS:5:1 '= "The thief stabs a deep cut in your upper arm."
Z_THIEF_REMARKS:5:2 '= "The stiletto touches your forehead, and the blood obscures your\nvision."
Z_THIEF_REMARKS:5:3 '= "The thief strikes at your wrist, and suddenly your grip is slippery\nwith blood."
Z_THIEF_REMARK_COUNT:6 = 3
Z_THIEF_REMARKS:6:0 '= "The butt of his stiletto cracks you on the skull, and you stagger\nback."
Z_THIEF_REMARKS:6:1 '= "The thief rams the haft of his blade into your stomach, leaving\nyou out of breath."
Z_THIEF_REMARKS:6:2 '= "The thief attacks, and you fall back desperately."
Z_THIEF_REMARK_COUNT:7 = 3
Z_THIEF_REMARKS:7:0 '= "A long, theatrical slash. You catch it on your @WEP@, but the\nthief twists his knife, and the @WEP@ goes flying."
Z_THIEF_REMARKS:7:1 '= "The thief neatly flips your @WEP@ out of your hands, and it drops\nto the floor."
Z_THIEF_REMARKS:7:2 '= "You parry a low thrust, and your @WEP@ slips out of your hand."
Z_THIEF_REMARK_COUNT:8 = 3
Z_THIEF_REMARKS:8:0 '= "The thief, a man of superior breeding, pauses for a moment to consider the propriety of finishing you off."
Z_THIEF_REMARKS:8:1 '= "The thief amuses himself by searching your pockets."
Z_THIEF_REMARKS:8:2 '= "The thief entertains himself by rifling your pack."
Z_THIEF_REMARK_COUNT:9 = 2
Z_THIEF_REMARKS:9:0 '= "The thief, forgetting his essentially genteel upbringing, cuts your\nthroat."
Z_THIEF_REMARKS:9:1 '= "The thief, a pragmatist, dispatches you as a threat to his\nlivelihood."
RETURN
